    {
      "number": 12,
      "category": "",
      "title": "敬夏太后與敬王皇后",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p001",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "敬夏太后，會稽人也。普通中，納于湘東王宮，生敬帝。承聖元年冬，拜晉安王國太妃。紹泰元年，尊為太后。明年冬，降為江陰國太妃。",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p001"
